<title>USA: Omaha cattle firm/up $0.25 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle firm/up $0.25 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were firm to $0.25 higher.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-4 1000-1250 lbs 63.50-65.00, few weighing conditions 65.50-66.00. Select 62.00-64.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select to choice 2-4 950-1200 lbs 63.00-65.00. Select 61.00-63.50.</p>
</text>
